          <change when="2013-11-11T11:39:19.837-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/simoeis">Vote - AcceptText - Ln2: change to final sigma is fine.  The app. entry here is ambiguous, however.  What BL 8, 169 did was introduce μισθ(ωτῶν) between πό[λει and τρα(πέζης).  Perhaps the markup should be &lt;:πό[λει (μισθ(ωτῶν)) (τρα(πέζης))=BL cf. 8.169|ed|πό[λει (τρα(πέζης)):&gt;. Next voter?  All other typo corrections are fine--note that ε[ὐδο]κῷ (ln. 38) is a mistake found already in Chrest.Mitt. (a very old 'data entry' error, that is!).  Finalizer: rename so that chrest.mitt;;173 = p.tebt;2;389 is no longer coupled with this file.</change>
          <change when="2013-10-28T13:17:40.644-04:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/dieter.hagedorn">Korrektur mehrerer Eingabefehler: &#xD;
